app-graphics-start-failed-title = Block Viewer kann nicht starten
app-graphics-start-failed = Block Viewer konnte keine Grafikkarte öffnen, um sein Fenster zu zeichnen.
    Block Viewer could not open a graphics card to draw its window.

    What to try:
    • update the graphics card driver;
    • on a PC with two graphics cards, check that both are enabled in Device Manager, and that the monitor is plugged into the card that should draw;
    • restart the PC.

    Details: { $e }

    The log of this start: { $log }
app-gpu-stall-title = Block Viewer: Die Grafikkarte reagiert nicht
app-gpu-stall =
    The graphics card has not finished an image for { $seconds } seconds. Block still works (the world, the sound, the chat go on) but nothing can be drawn until the card answers again.

    What to try:
    • wait a little: a graphics driver that resets itself can take several seconds;
    • update the graphics card driver;
    • turn off the overlays of other programs (Discord, Steam, MSI Afterburner…);
    • at the next start, choose the safe graphics that Block will offer.

    Keep waiting? Yes keeps waiting; No closes Block (you are logged out properly).
app-gpu-lost-title = Block Viewer: Die Grafikkarte ging verloren
app-gpu-lost = Die Grafikkarte funktionierte nicht mehr für Block: Der Treiber wurde zurückgesetzt (es dauerte zu lange, um ein Bild zu zeichnen, oder der Videospeicher war voll), oder die Karte wurde entfernt oder von einem anderen Programm genommen. Nichts kann mehr gezogen werden: Block schließt, wenn Sie OK drücken (Sie sind ordnungsgemäß abgemeldet).
    The graphics card stopped working for Block: its driver was reset (it took too long to draw an image, or its video memory was full), or the card was removed or taken by another program. Nothing can be drawn any more: Block closes when you press OK (you are logged out properly).

    What to try:
    • update the graphics card driver;
    • lower the size of very large photos, or the graphics quality;
    • close the other programs that use the graphics card a lot;
    • at the next start, choose the safe graphics that Block will offer.
